{"1-10":{"people":[{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":4,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"aaron-h0175","name":"Aaron","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"kohath-h6955","name":"Kohath","kind":"person","brief":"Levi's son","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"uriel-h0222h","name":"Uriel","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"asaiah-h6222k","name":"Asaiah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"merari-h4847","name":"Merari","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Levi","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"gershon-h1648","name":"Gershon","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Levi","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"joel-h3100n","name":"Joel","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"elizaphan-h0469g","name":"Elizaphan","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Uzziel","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"shemaiah-h8098g","name":"Shemaiah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"eliel-h0447m","name":"Eliel","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"hebron-h2275b","name":"Hebron","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Kohath","count":1,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"amminadab-h5992h","name":"Amminadab","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"uzziel-h5816g","name":"Uzziel","kind":"person","brief":"Aaron's uncle","count":1,"firstVerse":10}],"places":[{"id":"jerusalem-h3389","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":3}],"words":[{"base":"H8269","lemma":"שַׂר","tr":"sar","gloss":"ruler","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":421},{"base":"H0251","lemma":"אָח","tr":"ach","gloss":"brother: male-sibling","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":629},{"base":"H3967","lemma":"מֵאָה","tr":"me·ah","gloss":"hundred","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":581},{"base":"H0727","lemma":"אֲרוֹן","tr":"a·ron","gloss":"ark","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":202},{"base":"H1732","lemma":"דָּוִד","tr":"da·vid","gloss":"David","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":1075},{"base":"H3559","lemma":"כּוּן","tr":"kun","gloss":"to establish: prepare","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":217},{"base":"H3881","lemma":"לֵוִי","tr":"le·viy·yi","gloss":"Levi","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":291},{"base":"H6242","lemma":"עֶשְׂרִים","tr":"es·rim","gloss":"twenty","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":315},{"base":"H4725","lemma":"מָקוֹם","tr":"ma·qom","gloss":"place","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":401},{"base":"H0222","lemma":"אוּרִיאֵל","tr":"u·ri·el","gloss":"Uriel","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":4}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"DEU","chapter":10,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"At that time the LORD set apart the tribe of Levi to carry the ark of the covenant of the LORD, to stand before the LORD to serve Him, and to pronounce blessings in His name, as they do to this day.","from":2},{"book":"DEU","chapter":31,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"So Moses wrote down this law and gave it to the priests, the sons of Levi, who carried the ark of the covenant of the LORD, and to all the elders of Israel.","from":2},{"book":"1KI","chapter":8,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"At that time Solomon assembled before him in Jerusalem the elders of Israel—all the tribal heads and family leaders of the Israelites—to bring up the ark of the covenant of the LORD from Zion, the City of David.","from":3},{"book":"1CH","chapter":13,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"So David assembled all Israel, from the River Shihor in Egypt to Lebo-hamath, to bring the ark of God from Kiriath-jearim.","from":3},{"book":"1CH","chapter":16,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"So they brought the ark of God and placed it inside the tent that David had pitched for it. And they presented burnt offerings and peace offerings before God.","from":1},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":16,"verseEnd":22,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the names of the sons of Levi according to their records: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari. Levi lived 137 years. The sons of Gershon were Libni and Shimei, by their clans. The sons of Kohath were Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel. Kohath lived 133 years. The sons of Merari were Mahli and Mushi. These were the clans of the Levites according to their records. And Amram married his fatherʼs sister Jochebed, and she bore him Aaron and Moses. Amram lived 137 years.","from":4},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Kohath were Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel. Kohath lived 133 years.","from":9},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Kohath were Amram, Izhar, Hebron, and Uzziel. Kohath lived 133 years.","from":10}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2},{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":2}]},"11-15":{"people":[{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":4,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"abiathar-h0054","name":"Abiathar","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"amminadab-h5992h","name":"Amminadab","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"asaiah-h6222k","name":"Asaiah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"eliel-h0447m","name":"Eliel","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"joel-h3100n","name":"Joel","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"shemaiah-h8098g","name":"Shemaiah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"uriel-h0222h","name":"Uriel","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"zadok-h6659g","name":"Zadok","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":2,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":1,"firstVerse":15}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H3881","lemma":"לֵוִי","tr":"le·viy·yi","gloss":"Levi","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":291},{"base":"H0727","lemma":"אֲרוֹן","tr":"a·ron","gloss":"ark","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":202},{"base":"H0859","lemma":"אַתָּ֫ה","tr":"at·tah","gloss":"you(m.s.)","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":1092},{"base":"H6942","lemma":"קָדַשׁ","tr":"qa·dash","gloss":"to consecrate: consecate","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":171},{"base":"H0222","lemma":"אוּרִיאֵל","tr":"u·ri·el","gloss":"Uriel","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"H6222","lemma":"עֲשָׂיָה","tr":"a·sa·yah","gloss":"Asaiah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":8},{"base":"H3548","lemma":"כֹּהֵן","tr":"ko·hen","gloss":"priest","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":750},{"base":"H0447","lemma":"אֱלִיאֵל","tr":"e·li·el","gloss":"Eliel","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":10},{"base":"H4133","lemma":"מוֹטָה","tr":"mo·tah","gloss":"yoke","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":12},{"base":"H5992","lemma":"עַמִּינָדָב","tr":"am·mi·na·dav","gloss":"Amminadab","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":13}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"2SA","chapter":6,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":10,"source":"both","text":"They set the ark of God on a new cart and brought it from the house of Abinadab, which was on the hill. Uzzah and Ahio, the sons of Abinadab, were guiding the new cart,","from":13},{"book":"1CO","chapter":14,"verse":40,"verseEnd":40,"votes":9,"source":"both","text":"But everything must be done in a proper and orderly manner.","from":13},{"book":"1CO","chapter":11,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"Now I commend you for remembering me in everything and for maintaining the traditions, just as I passed them on to you.","from":13},{"book":"1JN","chapter":1,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"If we say we have no sin, we deceive ourselves, and the truth is not in us.","from":13},{"book":"1JN","chapter":1,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"If we say we have not sinned, we make Him out to be a liar, and His word is not in us.","from":13},{"book":"NUM","chapter":4,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"When Aaron and his sons have finished covering the holy objects and all their equipment, as soon as the camp is ready to move, the Kohathites shall come and do the carrying. But they must not touch the holy objects, or they will die. These are the transportation duties of the Kohathites regarding the Tent of Meeting.","from":13},{"book":"NUM","chapter":4,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"When Aaron and his sons have finished covering the holy objects and all their equipment, as soon as the camp is ready to move, the Kohathites shall come and do the carrying. But they must not touch the holy objects, or they will die. These are the transportation duties of the Kohathites regarding the Tent of Meeting.","from":15},{"book":"NUM","chapter":7,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"But he did not give any to the Kohathites, since they were to carry on their shoulders the holy objects for which they were responsible.","from":13}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"kings-prophets","title":"Kings, prophets and the house of David","people":3},{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2}]},"16-24":{"people":[{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":3,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"asaph-h0623g","name":"Asaph","kind":"person","brief":"Returned musician","count":2,"fi